Arara Code: raise the minimum width of the right-hand (auxiliary) bar from 170 to 330 px.

Why a patch: the minimum size of a workbench part is a constant of AuxiliaryBarPart.
No extension API or setting changes it, and a CSS min-width inside a webview would
still let the bar shrink and add horizontal scrolling to the chat.
Touches: src/vs/workbench/browser/parts/auxiliarybar/auxiliaryBarPart.ts

--- a/src/vs/workbench/browser/parts/auxiliarybar/auxiliaryBarPart.ts
+++ b/src/vs/workbench/browser/parts/auxiliarybar/auxiliaryBarPart.ts
@@ -55,7 +55,7 @@
 	static readonly viewContainersWorkspaceStateKey = 'workbench.auxiliarybar.viewContainersWorkspaceState';
 
 	// Use the side bar dimensions
-	override readonly minimumWidth: number = 170;
+	override readonly minimumWidth: number = 330;
 	override readonly maximumWidth: number = Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY;
 	override readonly minimumHeight: number = 0;
 	override readonly maximumHeight: number = Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY;
